{
  "phase": "phase-5",
  "approved": true,
  "summary": "Phase 5: cross-session analytics + taper mode. Added a pure analytics module (engine/analytics.ts) with `sessionTrend`, `cueTrend`, `cueAggregate`, `compareSessions`, `pickTaperCues`, and `buildTaperProfileBlueprint` — every public helper unit-tested. Extracted `best10AvgOf` and `correctGoTimesOf` into engine/drill.ts as the single source of truth for both metrics, and refactored `cueBreakdown` to call them (closing the DRY hole architecture-red-team flagged in the memo). New Dexie helper `listRepsForSessions` bulk-fetches reps grouped by sessionId via the existing reps.sessionId index — no schema bump. New AnalyticsScreen with a loading state, empty state, per-session trend table with four inline-SVG sparklines (Avg RT, Best-10 RT, FS rate, Hes rate), a per-cue table with RT-trend sparkline, and a compare section with default
