[tool_result] toolu_01FrrKhkbiuG1gVQVX6rYX8n 1	# Architecture
2	
3	## Stack
4	
5	- Vite
6	- React
7	- TypeScript
8	- Zustand for state
9	- Dexie/IndexedDB for local persistence
10	- Web Audio API for cue sounds
11	- HTML5 video for opponent clips
12	- Optional webcam pose detection in later phase
13	
14	## Main Modules
15	
16	### Drill Engine
17	
18	Responsible for:
19	
20	- selecting next cue
21	- applying random delay
22	- starting cue timer
23	- accepting response
24	- classifying result
25	- producing rep record
26	
27	### Cue Library
28	
29	Stores:
30	
31	- text cues
32	- image cues
33	- video cues
34	- cue metadata
35	- correct responses
36	- go/no-go classification
37	
38	### Session Store
39	
40	Stores:
41	
42	- drill config
43	- rep results
44	- session summaries
45	- athlete notes
46	
47	### Input Layer
48	
49	Supports:
50	
51	- keyboard
52	- foot pedal as keyboard
53	- optional webcam movement detection
54	
55	### Analytics
56	
57	Computes:
58	
59	- average reaction time
60	- best 10-rep average
61	- cue-specific accur
